04)------RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(4), input_partitions=1, maintains_sort_order=true
05)--------DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [[WORKSPACE_ROOT/datafusion/sqllogictest/test_files/scratch/parquet_sorted_statistics/arithmetic_bounds.parquet]]}, projection=[a], output_ordering=[a@0 ASC NULLS LAST], file_type=parquet, predicate=a@0 % 2 = 1

